# Mox, which makes {R} and no {U}. On turn 2 (Bot2's first main phase) the pool is empty. On turn 3 the trigger adds {U}{R},
# restricted: Delver of Secrets, a creature spell for {U}, is refused although {U} floats in the pool. The restricted {R}
# pays Lightning Bolt (3 damage) and leaves the {U} (the Mox is still untapped), which empties with the phase (CR 106.4):
# in the second main phase there is no {U} for Opt.

